Features
-   Bootup: Start ESP ->  Powerboard enable
                          Keep track of board power on or off
                          Keep track of laser state
                          Keep track of USB connection
                          Keep track of TCP connection


Board power:
- Keep track of whether the board power is on or off

Laser state:
- Keep track of whether the laser is on or off

USB connection:
- If USB connection is lost, force powerdown board

TCP connection:
- If TCP connection is lost, force M5

Info:
M3 + Svalue - set laser power on
M4 + Svalue - set dynamic laser power with movement speed
M5 - turn off laser
$32=1 - laser turns off automatically when no movement is detected
